{"id":"ecdf039ac295751f","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-independent-cover-duality.md","title":"独立集与补顶点覆盖的对偶","display":"thm-independent-cover-duality — 独立集与补顶点覆盖的对偶","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-independent-cover-duality","aliases":["73-thm-independent-cover-duality"],"display":"thm-independent-cover-duality — 独立集与补顶点覆盖的对偶","depends_on":["[[73-df-independent-set-language]]","[[73-df-vertex-cover-language]]","[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.3, Theorem 10.20, print p. 464; PDF p. 486; explicit total reduction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-independent-cover-duality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-independent-cover-duality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-independent-cover-duality — 独立集与补顶点覆盖的对偶"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ffeeb732a24b7769\" href=\"?note=ffeeb732a24b7769\" title=\"73-df-independent-set-language\">73-df-independent-set-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb6b14c0b3fd700\" href=\"?note=1eb6b14c0b3fd700\" title=\"73-df-vertex-cover-language\">73-df-vertex-cover-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.3, Theorem 10.20, print p. 464; PDF p. 486; explicit total reduction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V_n\">\\(S\\subseteq V_n\\)</span>；第一条函数赋值要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le n\">\\(k\\le n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\">\\(f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\)</span> 由下式定义，非法码及 k&gt;n 输入用固定否实例处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(V_n\\setminus S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(V_n\\setminus S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,n-k)\\quad(0\\le k\\le n),\\qquad\nf(w)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GI}^U(2,\\{\\{0,1\\}\\},0)\\quad\n\\bigl(w\\notin\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land k\\le n\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,n-k)\\quad(0\\le k\\le n),\\qquad\nf(w)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GI}^U(2,\\{\\{0,1\\}\\},0)\\quad\n\\bigl(w\\notin\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land k\\le n\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathsf{FP},\\qquad\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(w\\in\\mathsf{IS}\\Longleftrightarrow f(w)\\in\\mathsf{VC}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathsf{FP},\\qquad\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(w\\in\\mathsf{IS}\\Longleftrightarrow f(w)\\in\\mathsf{VC}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一条边未被补集覆盖，恰好表示它的两个端点都在 S。基数≥k 与补集基数≤n−k 对应。总函数的失败分支映到单边图的零覆盖界，确为否实例；解析与减法按输入长度是多项式时间。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-independent-set-language","status":"resolved","id":"ffeeb732a24b7769","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-independent-set-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-vertex-cover-language","status":"resolved","id":"1eb6b14c0b3fd700","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-vertex-cover-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V_n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Independent}_{n,E}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Cover}_{n,E}(V_n\\setminus S).","display":true},{"tex":"f(\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k))\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,n-k)\\quad(0\\le k\\le n),\\qquad\nf(w)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{GI}^U(2,\\{\\{0,1\\}\\},0)\\quad\n\\bigl(w\\notin\\{\\operatorname{GI}^U(n,E,k):n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\land k\\le n\\}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathsf{FP},\\qquad\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(w\\in\\mathsf{IS}\\Longleftrightarrow f(w)\\in\\mathsf{VC}).","display":true}],"bytes":1828,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-independent-cover-duality|独立集与补顶点覆盖的对偶]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"72b2b1213d426b99","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ffeeb732a24b7769","1eb6b14c0b3fd700","0173e0f8c9568f2f"]}